               nodejs (>= 22.13)
Homepage: https://github.com/wirenboard/wb-nodejs-service-template

Package: wb-nodejs-service-template
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         nodejs (>= 22.13)
Recommends: mosquitto
Description: Network traffic of the controller as a device
 Publishes a virtual device with the receive rate of a network interface, the
 peak rate since the last reset and the uptime of the service itself, so the
 traffic of the controller is visible in the web interface and usable in rules.
 .
 The package doubles as the template of a Node.js service for Wiren Board: the
 systemd unit, the config with a schema for the web interface, the tests and the
 packaging are meant to be copied. Dependencies are vendored at build time, so
 the controller needs no network and no compilation.
